# P2 from dead to long: xylophone at P2 0, 32, 64, 96, 128, 160, 192, 224, 255 (one hit each, two voices on the
# snare track alternate), then a glass and a gong hit at P2 255 ring on under the tail.
tempo 120
steps 56
tail 1.5
track snare
preset 64 0 0 0 255 0 0 0 128 0 128 200 0 128 100 255 0 0
note 0 60 1 120
param p2 32 4
note 4 60 1 120
param p2 64 8
note 8 60 1 120
param p2 96 12
note 12 60 1 120
param p2 128 16
note 16 60 1 120
param p2 160 20
note 20 60 1 120
param p2 192 24
note 24 60 1 120
param p2 224 28
note 28 60 1 120
param p2 255 32
note 32 60 1 120
param p1 255 40
note 40 64 1 120
param p1 223 44
note 44 41 1 127
# end: two dead wood hits per track, together, steal the ringing voices (they fade in 2.9 ms, the wood ends at once)
track snare
param p1 0 48
param p2 0 48
note 52 53 1 90
note 52 53 1 90
expect sound 0 48
expect peak_below 0
expect idle 62
